==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|la|h₂ey}}
Syncope of earlier {{l|la|aevitās}}, from {{inh|la|itc-pro|*aiwotāts}}, from {{m|itc-pro|*aiwom}} (whence also {{m|la|aevum}}) + {{m|itc-pro|*-tāts}} (whence also {{m|la|-tās}}), from {{der|la|ine-pro|*h₂ey-u-||vital energy}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*h₂ey-}}. Surface etymology: from {{suffix|la|aevum|tās}}.

